></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∭</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∭</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></munder><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>θ</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>If <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"46\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hid